---

### States & Keyboard Contract

| State | Trigger | Visual |
|---|---|---|
| **Default** | rest | `var(--shadow-card)`, `1px` border |
| **Hover** | `:hover` | lifted shadow + `translateY(-2px)` (skipped under `prefers-reduced-motion`) |
| **Focus-visible** | `Tab` / keyboard | `2px` solid `var(--accent)` outline + `3px` glow ring |
| **Selected** | `aria-selected="true"` / `data-state="selected"` | `var(--selected-bg)` fill + `3px` left accent bar |
| **Disabled button** | `disabled` / `aria-disabled="true"` | `var(--disabled-bg)` + `var(--disabled-fg)`, pointer blocked, `aria-describedby` hint |
| **Loading skeleton** | `card--skeleton` class | dimension-matched shimmer (`1.4s` linear, paused under `prefers-reduced-motion`) |
| **Empty filter** | no results | `role="status" aria-live="polite"` panel + 44px "Reset filters" button |
| **Inline error** | `data-state="error"` | `role="alert" aria-live="assertive"` banner + Retry button with 1.8s loading state |

Filter chips toggle `aria-pressed`. Retry button disables itself during the pending state and re-enables on resolve.

